OL,3,GNEWSAGrandmother's cancer can be
OL,4,Atreated with tablets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandmother with stage four lung
OL,7,Fcancer says she is looking forward to
OL,8,Fenjoying life after discovering it
OL,9,Fcould be controlled with just two daily
OL,10,Ftablets.
OL,12,FChristina Isik, 71, from Hindley in
OL,13,FGreater Manchester, was on holiday with
OL,14,Fher husband in Turkey two years ago
OL,15,Fwhen she suddenly fell ill.
OL,17,FUsing a cutting-edge blood test,
OL,18,Fscientists have found Christina's
OL,19,Fcancer has a genetic mutation which
OL,20,Fallows her to be treated with tablets
OL,21,Frather than more conventional
OL,22,Ftechniques like chemotherapy.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
